{"reviews":[{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-0","r":4.0,"t":"Nice, not great but worth the cost","x":"Smaller than I thought, pretty but not exactly like the pic. The clasp is a bit difficult and I almost broke it right away but as long as you're careful they are nice earrings especially for the price.","h":37,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-1","r":2.0,"t":"TINY","x":"I am living with these because they took a long time to arrive (expected) and are not worth the cost to ship back - but I was like -----where is it? when I opened the package. They were that small. Not at all like the pic and TINY - seriously tiny. I had intended to wear in my bottom hole in my ears but they are so small, I can only use in the top hole.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-2","r":3.0,"t":"Cute but to small","x":"They are very pretty but the size of them is very small would be great for a little girl the picture  is kind of  miss leading  I'm giving them to my sisters girl.  I have a photo so you can see the size comparison","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-3","r":2.0,"t":"Too tiny...and ships all the way from China!","x":"Too tiny! These earrings are cute, but they're too small to get through my ear holes & fastened properly (or easily). It arrived in a tiny package that came all the way from China without getting lost. That, in itself, is impressive. But I've got to stop buying products from China! Too cheap...","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-4","r":5.0,"t":"Glad I bought two pairs","x":"Glad I bought two pairs.  I can sleep in them.  The locking mechanism is good and tight.  Great for the troubles of the off / on winter sweater, neckscarf, and hat.  Stays put = closed and very subtle light grabber without any stones for bright light capturing.  Good workmanship also.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-5","r":3.0,"t":"I really worry when I purchase earrings, My concerns ...","x":"I really worry when I purchase earrings, My concerns are lead based jewelry These earrings are really cute, just the right size, but one came broken at the hinge. Since paying only a couple dollars decided not to pursue a return. I may just reorder and hopefully I'd then have 3.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-6","r":3.0,"t":"I recomend for Casual wear","x":"They arrived earlier than I expected, they are nice and very light easy to put on. The flowers are not as defined as the image but still are nice for casual wear. I like them, overall good buy","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great and very pretty","x":"Love it! Dainty, look expensive, and very comfortable. Fast delivery!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great earrings","x":"Great price and beautiful earrings.  After I bought them for myself, I bought several pairs to give away as gifts.  Worth the price.  I've had mind for a while now with no issues!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-9","r":5.0,"t":"in love with them","x":"I use this day/ and night they dont weight, and doesn't change color either I like them a lot buying to give them as gift I believe is silver","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-10","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"So incredibly tiny. Can't even tell they are flowers, let alone anything but silver circles.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-11","r":5.0,"t":"doesn't irritate my ear for a cheap price and with a good quality.","x":"Cute, doesn't irritate my ear for a cheap price and with a good quality.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-12","r":4.0,"t":"Comfortable and pretty, just not quite as pictured.","x":"They look more like little diamond earrings, than little flowers. I didn't even realize it was supposed to have stones until it arrived. I thought it was two different styles (flowers or stones).  They're pretty, light, and functional. I have very sensitive ears, and these do not bother them at all. I've been wearing them every day since I got them and they're comfortable with no problems.  I just wish they were more subtle flowers (as pictured) and not raised stones. That's ok. I like them enou","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-13","r":5.0,"t":"Updated review","x":"Update, so when I 1st got these one of the earrings was non functional (wouldn't close). I got contacted by the seller and they quickly sent me new pair and I love them!!!!! I would buy them again in the future if need be.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-14","r":5.0,"t":"Nice! But not like the picture","x":"Cute and delicate but the flowers aren't as pretty as the ones on the picture. I love them still and get lots of compliments on them but they're not as expected. Arrived quickly and very cute though!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-15","r":5.0,"t":"They are really beautiful and wish that they had them for adults","x":"the hoops are tiny I will be giving them to my niece who just got her ears pierced for her first holy communion. They are really beautiful and wish that they had them for adults. really nice earrings","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-16","r":2.0,"t":"They arrived bent and the clasps didn't line up. ...","x":"They arrived bent and the clasps didn't line up. I tried to straighten them out a little, but they're still a little misshaped. Okay for the money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-17","r":4.0,"t":"The only thing is when the package arrived there was ...","x":"The only thing is when the package arrived there was only 1 of them in the little baggie, after  waited all that time and only got 1 ear ring","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-18","r":3.0,"t":"Alot smaller than I thought they would be, They ...","x":"Alot smaller than I thought they would be, They are very cute though, I will giver them to  my 3 year old niece","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"My daughter and I bought these and we love our earrings so very much they're pretty","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-20","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Earnings that are 3/8 inch in diameter are for infants not women.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-21","r":5.0,"t":"These are very pretty.. my teenaged daughter loves them","x":"These are very pretty..my teenaged daughter loves them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great material. They look just like the pictures.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-23","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"These came and one of them wouldn't even buckle !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00P0BLZFI-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Very cute little earrings for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the earrings much smaller than expected and not matching the product photo.","cites":[1,2,3,4,11,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the earrings as pretty, cute, and good value for the low price.","cites":[1,3,8,9,12,15]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers describe the earrings as comfortable and lightweight, suitable for sensitive ears or everyday wear.","cites":[5,7,8,10,12,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers report quality or durability issues such as broken hinges or clasps that won't close.","cites":[1,6,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the flower design is less defined than pictured, resembling plain circles or stones.","cites":[11,13,15]}]},"qa":[]}